  "description": "CR 715.2b, 715.2c, 715.2d, 715.4, 111.1, 122.1b: Summon: Knights of Round makes three 2/2 white Knights on each of chapters I to IV, then its chapter V gives every other creature its controller controls +2/+2 and an indestructible counter, and it is sacrificed after V",
  "note": "Chapters I-IV each add three Knights, 3, 6, 9, 12. Chapter V reaches alice's Hill Giant (3/3 to 5/5) and the twelfth Knight (2/2 to 4/4), each with one indestructible counter, but not bob's Grizzly Bears, an opponent's. The Saga is sacrificed once chapter V leaves the stack, Indestructible notwithstanding (CR 715.4), so whether it excludes itself is unobservable here. Three seats so the turn count reaches alice every third turn and an opponent's creature is distinct from the next player's.",
